{"seq":1,"slug":"semantic-search","title":"语义检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/semantic-search","wordCount":1356,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"语义检索\">语义检索</h1><p>「找一下处理用户登录失败的逻辑」——这种查询里可能一个真实标识符都没有，却要命中代码库里那个叫 <code>handleAuthRejection</code> 的函数。词法检索在这种「知意图、不知名字」的查询上无能为力，而语义检索正是为它而生。这篇讲在线检索的第一种手段：把查询编码成向量，在嵌入空间里捞最近邻。它消费的是 <a href=\"../indexing/code-embeddings\">代码嵌入</a> 算出的向量和 <a href=\"../indexing/index-structures\">索引结构</a> 建好的 ANN 索引。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>语义检索的运行时只有三步：把查询用同一个嵌入模型编码成向量、在 ANN 索引里找与它最近的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个块向量、把对应的原始代码块取回来。关键在于「同一个嵌入模型」——查询和代码必须映射到同一个向量空间，相似度才有意义（向量空间与相似度定义见 <a href=\"../indexing/code-embeddings\">代码嵌入</a>）。</p>\n<p>语义检索的强项和弱项几乎是镜像的：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询类型</th>\n<th>语义检索表现</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自然语言意图</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>嵌入捕捉语义而非字面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨语言/近义概念</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>语义相近即向量相近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确符号名</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>罕见标识符语义信号稀薄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>罕见缩写/拼写变体</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>嵌入易把它们当噪声</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了为什么语义检索几乎从不单独使用，而总要和词法检索搭档（见 <a href=\"lexical-hybrid\">词法与混合检索</a>）——它们的强弱项恰好互补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询侧的工程-不是直接拿用户输入去查\">查询侧的工程：不是直接拿用户输入去查</h2><p>一个常见误区是把用户的原始问题直接编码去检索。实践中查询侧往往要先加工，因为「用户怎么问」和「代码怎么写」之间有鸿沟。几种主流加工手段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>查询改写</strong>：用一个小模型把口语化问题改写成更贴近代码的描述，或拆成多个子查询分别检索再合并。</li>\n<li><strong>HyDE（假设性文档嵌入）</strong>：先让模型根据问题「脑补」一段可能的实现代码，再用这段假想代码去检索。因为「代码 vs 代码」的向量距离通常小于「问题 vs 代码」，命中率往往更高。</li>\n<li><strong>多查询融合</strong>：同一意图生成若干变体查询，各自检索后融合结果，缓解单一措辞带来的偏差。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[用户问题] --&gt; B{查询加工}&#10;    B --&gt;|改写| C[贴近代码的描述]&#10;    B --&gt;|HyDE| D[脑补一段实现]&#10;    C --&gt; E[嵌入模型编码]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[ANN 索引查 top-k]&#10;    F --&gt; G[取回原始代码块]&#10;    G --&gt; H[交给重排]\">flowchart TD\n    A[用户问题] --&gt; B{查询加工}\n    B --&gt;|改写| C[贴近代码的描述]\n    B --&gt;|HyDE| D[脑补一段实现]\n    C --&gt; E[嵌入模型编码]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[ANN 索引查 top-k]\n    F --&gt; G[取回原始代码块]\n    G --&gt; H[交给重排]</pre><p>这些加工都在「召回」环节起作用——目标是让真正相关的块尽量进入候选集，至于排序的精修交给后面的重排（见 <a href=\"reranking-filtering\">重排与过滤</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相似度-阈值与-top-k\">相似度、阈值与 top-k</h2><p>语义检索返回的不只是块，还有每个块的相似度分数。用好这个分数有两个旋钮。</p>\n<p>一是 <strong>top-k 的取值</strong>。这直接关联窗口预算（见 <a href=\"../foundations/retrieval-vs-context\">检索与上下文窗口</a>）——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 太小漏召回，太大引噪声。常见做法是粗排阶段取较大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（如 50–100）保召回，再靠重排收敛到喂给模型的几块。</p>\n<p>二是<strong>相似度阈值</strong>。设定一个最低相似度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，过滤掉「最近邻但其实没那么近」的块。但代码检索里阈值要谨慎：不同查询的分数分布差异很大，固定阈值容易误杀。一个稳健的替代是相对阈值——只保留与 top-1 分数差距在一定比例内的块：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>keep</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>top1</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{keep}(c) = \\big[\\, \\text{sim}(q, c) \\ge \\alpha \\cdot \\text{sim}(q, c_{\\text{top1}}) \\,\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">keep</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\in (0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这比绝对阈值对查询分布的鲁棒性更好。</p>\n<p>两个旋钮如果要落成默认值，可以这样起步再按端到端表现微调：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>常见起步值</th>\n<th>调大方向的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粗排 top-k</td>\n<td>50–100</td>\n<td>召回升、重排负担升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对阈值 α</td>\n<td>0.7–0.8</td>\n<td>候选更少、更依赖重排精度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意两者是联动的：若把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 调大，α 通常也该调大，否则低分尾部的噪声会一并进入重排。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语义检索的天花板\">语义检索的天花板</h2><p>必须诚实面对语义检索的上限。上一章已论证代码的意义靠精确符号（见 <a href=\"../foundations/code-vs-text-retrieval\">代码检索的特殊性</a>），而嵌入本质是把符号「揉」进连续空间——这个揉的过程天然会模糊掉精确性。于是会出现两类典型失败：把名字相近但语义无关的函数排到前面，或把真正该命中的罕见标识符漏在召回之外。</p>\n<p>这也是为什么 2026 年纯语义检索在 SWE-bench 上打不过 grep（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-code-retrieval\">为什么需要代码检索</a>）。语义检索的正确定位不是「代码检索的主力」，而是「混合检索里负责模糊意图的那一路」。它解决词法解决不了的问题，词法解决它解决不了的问题，二者相加才完整——具体怎么相加，是下一篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>语义检索运行时三步：用同一嵌入模型编码查询、ANN 查 top-k、取回原始块。</li>\n<li>强在自然语言意图与近义概念，弱在精确符号与罕见标识符，与词法恰好互补。</li>\n<li>查询侧常加工（改写、HyDE、多查询融合），目标是提升召回而非排序精修。</li>\n<li>top-k 关联窗口预算，相似度阈值宜用相对阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>sim</mtext><mtext>top1</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\cdot \\text{sim}_{\\text{top1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.954em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">top1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以抗查询分布差异。</li>\n<li>嵌入天然模糊掉精确性，语义检索定位是混合检索里负责模糊意图的一路，须与 <a href=\"lexical-hybrid\">词法检索</a> 合用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语义检索","id":"语义检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"查询侧的工程：不是直接拿用户输入去查","id":"查询侧的工程-不是直接拿用户输入去查"},{"level":2,"text":"相似度、阈值与 top-k","id":"相似度-阈值与-top-k"},{"level":2,"text":"语义检索的天花板","id":"语义检索的天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"索引结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/indexing/index-structures"},"next":{"title":"词法与混合检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/lexical-hybrid"}}